## Before broker apply

- [ ] Review `tenant-readiness-report.md` and resolve every blocking discovery
  finding, or document an approved exception before using
  `LZ_BOOTSTRAP_ALLOW_NOT_READY=true`.
- [ ] Authenticate Azure CLI to tenant
  `{{FACTORY-RAW:azure.tenantId}}` with permission to manage app registrations,
  service principals, federated credentials, subscription RBAC, and the selected
  backend.
- [ ] Authenticate GitHub CLI to
  `{{FACTORY-RAW:computed.repositorySlug}}` with repository administration,
  Actions variable, environment, and branch-protection access.
- [ ] Confirm the default branch is
  `{{FACTORY-RAW:computed.defaultBranch}}`.
- [ ] Review the exact plan:
  `pwsh ./bootstrap-broker.ps1` (plan-only by default).
- [ ] Confirm every planned identity is repo-scoped and no OIDC subject contains
  a wildcard.

## Azure Storage backend

- [ ] Confirm the backend subscription, resource group, storage account, and
  container names are approved and globally unique where required.
- [ ] Confirm the operator can create the backend resources and data-plane
  container using Entra authentication. State access is OIDC + Azure AD only
  (`use_oidc`, `use_azuread_auth`) — no shared keys, no SAS tokens.

## Module pins

- [ ] The Azure Verified Modules pattern-module pins and the ALZ library
  reference in this repository were set by the generator at render time.
  Re-verify them on the first `terraform init` and let Renovate manage them
  from then on — module updates never involve the factory.

## Apply provenance

- [ ] Run render and read-only plan before apply; review the configuration hash,
  every layer log, and destructive-change result.
- [ ] Approve apply only through the exact protected environment and preserve
  independent Azure/state/OIDC/GitHub read-back evidence.
- [ ] Do not mark `endToEndGenerationProofPasses` from code completion, skipped
  execution, render-only output, or plan success.

## Release evidence provenance

- [ ] Preserve the successful, unskipped Factory CI report and the successful
  end-to-end generation proof report for the exact factory version stamped
  here.
- [ ] Independently review Azure, state, OIDC, active modules, and branch
  protection; bind the approval to both report SHA-256 values using
